Package: plotly.R.core
Type: Package
Title: Create Interactive Web Graphics via 'plotly.js'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Matthew", "Summersgill", email = "matthew.summersgill@hpinc.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Plotly Technologies Inc.", role = "cph",
           comment = "Bundled 'plotly.js' library; templates and datasets from 'plotly.py'")
  )
Description: Create interactive web graphics with the 'plotly.js' JavaScript
    library. Graph objects, their validation and their documentation are
    generated from the 'plotly.js' plot schema, following the design of the
    'plotly' Python package. Includes an 'express' interface for quick
    figures, 'htmlwidgets' rendering, 'shiny' and 'quarto' integration, and
    static image export with 'Kaleido'.
